== Trivia ==
* [[anti:Knife Piece 2|Knife Piece 2]] is from the ''Antibirth'' mod. In ''Antibirth'', Isaac would acquire Knife Piece 2 by pressing the right sequence of buttons in a special room instead of entering the abandoned area and being chased by Mother’s Shadow. Once the sequence was solved, Knife Piece 2 would always automatically appear in the center of the special room on subsequent runs.
** Knife Piece 2 was also not the final piece, with 3 knife pieces being needed to be combined to make the knife familiar. Moreover, the sprites for Knife Piece 2 was only the left half of the blade, with the 3rd knife piece being the right half.

